Package: sni-tunnel
Version: 0.4.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, ca-certificates
Recommends: xray-core
Description: VMess/VLESS/Trojan client with a custom TLS SNI and a full-tunnel mode
 SNI Tunnel is a lightweight client for VMess, VLESS and Trojan servers that
 supports an independent custom TLS SNI (the server name may differ from the
 address that is dialled).
 .
 It can run as a system proxy (Windows) or as a full tunnel that routes the
 whole device through the server (TUN mode, Windows, requires Administrator).
 .
 The tunneling itself is done by Xray-core, which is downloaded and verified
 against a pinned SHA-256 on first use.
